Walking is the healthiest and simplest form of exercise. We have transformed the枯燥 routine of walking into a fun and gamified application. Here, you can intuitively see whether the distance you have accumulated over your lifetime can circle the Earth. In addition to Earth, we have also included the Moon, the Sun, and the eight planets of the solar system to make your walking activity even more engaging.

Core Features:
· Real-time display of progress in circling a planet;
· Track daily step count and walking/running distance;
· Set and monitor daily step goals;
· View activity history through an intuitive calendar view;
· Access detailed monthly statistics and progress reports;
